@AbonStock.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5299

### Get OpenAPI Swagger Specification
GET {{AbonStock.Api_HostAddress}}/swagger/v1/swagger.json
Accept: application/json

###

### List Products
GET {{AbonStock.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

###

### List Orders
GET {{AbonStock.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Order by ID (Demo Order 3 - Pending)
GET {{AbonStock.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/3
Accept: application/json

###

### List Stock Movements Audit Ledger
GET {{AbonStock.Api_HostAddress}}/api/inventory/movements
Accept: application/json

###
